">'+pct+'%</b></div>'\n    + '<div class=\"fe-bar'+(R.status==='stopped'?' stopped':'')+'\"><i style=\"width:'+pct+'%\"></i></div>';\n  if(R.details){\n    h += '<ol class=\"fe-steps\">'+st.map(function(s, i){\n      var d = i < R.idx || done, cur = i === R.idx && !done;\n      return '<li class=\"'+(d?'done':cur?'cur':'')+'\"><span class=\"fe-sn\">'+(d?'<svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>':(i+1))+'</span><span>'+esc(s.label)+'</span>'+(cur && R.status==='running'?'<i class=\"d proc\" style=\"margin-left:auto;\"></i>':'')+'</li>';\n    }).join('')+'</ol>';\n    h += '<div class=\"fe-logwrap\"><div class=\"fe-log\" id=\"ixLog\" onscroll=\"ixLogScroll(this)\">'+R.logs.map(function(l){\n      return '<div class=\"fe-ll\"><span class=\"fe-lt\">'+l.time+'</span><span class=\"fe-ltag'+(l.tag==='TOOL_RESULT'?' tool':'')+'\">'+esc(l.raw.split(']')[0]+']')+'</span><span class=\"fe-lm '+l.level+'\">'+esc(l.fr)+'</span></div>';\n    }).join('')+'</div>'+(R.atBottom ? '' : '<button class=\"btn primary sm fe-jump\" onclick=\"IX_RUN[ixCurrent].atBottom=true;ixRenderProject()\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-chev-d\"/></svg>Jump to latest</button>')+'</div>';\n  }\n  h += '</div>';\n  // services\n  h += '<div class=\"card fe-pc\"><div class=\"fe-pc-h\"><h2 class=\"t-section\"><svg class=\"ic\" style=\"color:var(--teal)\"><use href=\"#i-ext\"/></svg>Services</h2>'+(done?'<span class=\"badge success live\"><i></i>Live</span>':'')+'</div>'\n    + '<div class=\"ix-svc\"><span class=\"ix-svc-dot'+(done?' on':'')+'\"></span><code>'+(done ? IX_TUNNEL : 'Tunnel opens once the services are running')+'</code>'\n    + '<button class=\"btn secondary sm\" '+dis(done)+'onclick=\"cxCopy(IX_TUNNEL)\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-copy\"/></svg>Copy URL</button>'\n    + '<button class=\"btn primary sm\" '+dis(done)+'onclick=\"toast(\\'Opening '+IX_TUNNEL+'\\')\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-ext\"/></svg>Open</button></div>'\n    + '<div class=\"ix-svc-grid\"><div><span class=\"t-label\">Frontend</span><b>:5173 · Vite</b></div><div><span class=\"t-label\">Backend</span><b>:8000 · Uvicorn</b></div></div></div>';\n  // verification\n  h += '<div class=\"card fe-pc\"><div class=\"fe-pc-h\"><h2 class=\"t-section\"><svg class=\"ic\" style=\"color:var(--rule)\"><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg>Verification Summary</h2>'\n    + (done ? '<span class=\"t-meta\">'+IX_CHECKS.filter(function(c){ return c.ok; }).length+' passed · '+IX_CHECKS.filter(function(c){ return !c.ok; }).length+' warnings</span>' : '')+'</div>'\n    + (done ? '<ul class=\"ix-checks\">'+IX_CHECKS.map(function(c){ return '<li class=\"'+(c.ok?'ok':'warn')+'\"><span><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-'+(c.ok?'check':'info')+'\"/></svg></span><div>'+c.t+'</div></li>'; }).join('')+'</ul>'\n            : '<p class=\"fe-sub\" style=\"margin:0;\">Checks run once the integration completes.</p>') + '</div>';\n  h += '</div>';\n  // sidebar\n  h += '<aside class=\"fe-pside\">';\n  h += '<div class=\"card fe-pc\"><h2 class=\"t-section fe-pc-t\">Actions</h2><div class=\"fe-acts\">'\n    + '<button class=\"btn primary block\" '+dis(done)+'onclick=\"openOverlay(\\'ixDownloadModal\\')\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg>Download Project</button>'\n    + '<button class=\"btn secondary block\" '+dis(done)+'onclick=\"toast(\\'Opening '+IX_TUNNEL+'\\')\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-ext\"/></svg>View Preview</button>'\n    + '<button class=\"btn secondary block\" '+dis(done)+'onclick=\"ixOpenPush()\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-github\"/></svg>Push to GitHub</button>'\n    + '<button class=\"btn secondary block\" '+dis(done)+'onclick=\"ixKnowledgeGraph()\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-graph\"/></svg>Knowledge Graph</button>'\n    + '<button class=\"btn secondary block\" '+dis(done)+'onclick=\"ixOpenModify()\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-sparkle\"/></svg>Modify App</button>'\n    + '<button class=\"btn danger block\" '+dis(R.status!=='stopped')+'onclick=\"openOverlay(\\'ixStopModal\\')\"><svg class=\"ic sm\"><use href=\"#i-x\"/></svg>Stop All Services</button>'\n    + '</div></div>';\n  h += '<div class=\"card fe-pc\"><h2 class=\"t-section fe-pc-t\">Status</h2><div class=\"fe-status '+statusCls+'\">'+statusLabel+'</div></div>';\n  h += '<div class=\"card fe-pc\"><h2 class=\"t-section fe-pc-t\"><svg class=\"ic\" style=\"color:var(--amber)\"><use href=\"#i-clock\"/></svg>Timeline</h2>'\n    + [['Created',p.created],['Started',p.created],['Completed',done?(p.past?(p.created):(p.done||'Just now')):'—']].map(function(x){ return '<div class=\"fe-tl\"><span>'+x[0]+'</span><b>'+esc(x[1])+'</b></div>'; }).join('')+'</div>';\n  if(R.mods.length) h += '<div class=\"card fe-pc\"><h2 class=\"t-section fe-pc-t\"><svg class=\"ic\" style=\"color:var(--teal)\"><use href=\"#i-sparkle\"/></svg>Modifications</h2><p class=\"fe-sub\">Changes requested on this project, newest first.</p>'\n    + R.mods.map(function(m){ return '<div class=\"fe-mod\"><p>'+esc(m.text)+'</p><div><span class=\"t-meta\">'+esc(m.time)+'</span><span class=\"badge '+(m.status==='applying'?'info live':'success')+'\"><i></i>'+(m.status==='applying'?'Applying':'Applied')+'</span></div></div>'; }).join('')+'</div>';\n  h += '</aside></div>';\n  $('ix-project').innerHTML = h;\n  var lb = $('ixLog'); if(lb){ if(R.atBottom) lb.scrollTop = lb.scrollHeight; else lb.scrollTop = prevTop; }\n}\nfunction ixLogScroll(el){\n  var R = IX_RUN[ixCurrent], bottom = el.scrollHeight - el.scrollTop - el.clientHeight < 24;\n  if(bottom !== R.atBottom){ R.atBottom = bottom; var top = el.scrollTop; ixRenderProject(); var lb = $('ixLog'); if(lb && !bottom) lb.scrollTop = top; }\n}\nfunction ixKnowledgeGraph(){\n  var p = IX_RUN[ixCurrent].p, graph = (PROJECTS.ix[p.name] && PROJECTS.ix[p.name].graph) || 'brownfield-node-react';\n  window.__kgFrom = {name:p.name, agent:'IntegrationX', hash:'integrationx.project.'+p.id, graph:graph};\n  go('knowledge-graph.' + graph);\n}\nfunction ixOpenModify(){ $('ixModText').value = ''; $('ixModApply').disabled = true; openOverlay('ixModifyModal'); setTimeout(function(){ $('ixModText').focus(); }, 40); }\nfunction ixApplyModify(){\n  var R = IX_RUN[ixCurrent], text = $('ixModText').value.trim(); if(!text) return;\n  var m = {text:text, time:feStamp(), status:'applying'}, id = ixCurrent;\n  R.mods.unshift(m); closeOverlay('ixModifyModal'); toast('Applying changes to ' + R.p.name); ixRenderProject();\n  setTimeout(function(){ m.status = 'applied'; if(ixCurrent === id) ixRenderProject(); }, 2500);\n}\nfunction ixDownload(what){ closeOverlay('ixDownloadModal'); toast('Downloading ' + {frontend:'frontend.zip', backend:'backend.zip', both:'integrated-project.zip'}[what]); }\nfunction ixConfirmStop(){\n  var R = IX_RUN[ixCurrent]; clearTimeout(R.timer); R.status = 'stopped';\n  closeOverlay('ixStopModal'); toast('Integration stopped and reset successfully.'); go('integrationx.new');\n}\n/* push dialog */\nvar ixPush = {combined:false, c:{repo:'', branch:''}, f:{repo:'', branch:''}, b:{repo:'', branch:''}};\nfunction ixOpenPush(){ ixPush = {combined:false, c:{repo:'', branch:''}, f:{repo:'', branch:''}, b:{repo:'', branch:''}}; ixPushRender(); openOverlay('ixPushModal'); }\nfunction ixPushPicker(k, label){\n  var all = []; IX_PROVIDERS.forEach(function(p){ if(IX_CONNECTED[p.id]) all = all.concat(IX_REPOS[p.id]); });\n  var v = ixPush[k], sel = all.filter(function(r){ return r.url === v.repo; })[0], br = sel ? sel.branches : IX_BRANCHES;\n  var branch = v.newBr\n    ? '<div class=\"fe-newbr\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"input\" placeholder=\"New branch name\" value=\"'+esc(v.branch)+'\" oninput=\"ixPush.'+k+'.branch=this.value;ixPushValid()\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost sm\" onclick=\"ixPush.'+k+'.newBr=false;ixPush.'+k+'.branch=\\'\\';ixPushRender()\">Cancel</button></div>'\n    : '<select class=\"input\" onchange=\"if(this.value===\\'__new__\\'){ixPush.'+k+'.newBr=true;ixPush.'+k+'.branch=\\'\\';ixPushRender();}else{ixPush.'+k+'.branch=this.value;ixPushValid();}\"><option value=\"\"'+(v.branch?'':' selected')+' disabled>Select branch…</option>'\n      + br.map(function(b){ return '<option'+(b===v.branch?' selected':'')+'>'+b+'</option>'; }).join('')+'<option value=\"__new__\">+ Create new branch…</option></select>';\n  return '<div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:12px;\">'\n    + feField(label+' repository', '<select class=\"input\" onchange=\"if(this.value===\\'__connect__\\'){closeOverlay(\\'ixPushModal\\');ixConnect(\\'github\\');}else{ixPush.'+k+'.repo=this.value;ixPush.'+k+'.branch=\\'\\';ixPushRender();}\"><option value=\"\">Same as source repository</option>'\n      + all.map(function(r){ return '<option value=\"'+r.url+'\"'+(r.url===v.repo?' selected':'')+'>'+esc(r.org+' / '+r.name)+'</option>'; }).join('')+'<option value=\"__connect__\">+ Connect another repository…</option></select>')\n    + feField(label+' branch', branch) + '</div>';\n}\nfunction ixPushRender(){\n  $('ixPushBody').innerHTML = '<div class=\"toggle-row fe-field\" style=\"border-bottom:none;\"><div><b>Push both to a single combined branch</b><div class=\"muted\">Off by default — frontend and backend are pushed to their own repositories</div></div>'\n    + '<input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Push both to a single combined branch\"'+(ixPush.combined?' checked':'')+' onchange=\"ixPush.combined=this.checked;ixPushRender()\"></div>'\n    + (ixPush.combined ? ixPushPicker('c', 'Combined') : '<div class=\"row2\">'+ixPushPicker('f', 'Frontend')+ixPushPicker('b', 'Backend')+'</div>');\n  ixPushValid();\n}\nfunction ixPushValid(){ $('ixPushGo').disabled = !(ixPush.combined ? ixPush.c.branch.trim() : ixPush.f.branch.trim() && ixPush.b.branch.trim()); }\nfunction ixPushSubmit(){ closeOverlay('ixPushModal'); toast('Integrated code pushed to GitHub'); }\n\nixRenderForm(); ixRenderRuns(); ixStats();\n\n\n/* ================= sign-in graphic: the Xccelera AI mark rebuilt from dots ================= */\n(function(){\n  var cv = document.getElementById('techDots'); if(!cv || !cv.getContext) return;\n  var ctx = cv.getContext('2d'), W = 0, H = 0, dpr = 1, col = {}, raf = 0, t0 = 0, cells = [], G = 76;\n  var mouse = {x:-9999, y:-9999}, reduce = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  function css(n, f){ var v = getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue(n).trim(); return v || f; }\n  function readColors(){ col = {ink:css('--ink','#e8ecf3'), dim:css('--dim','#8b93a1'), teal:css('--teal','#14b8a6'), blue:css('--blue','#3b82f6'), light:document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-eff') === 'light'}; }\n  function size(){ var r = cv.getBoundingClientRect(); dpr = Math.min(2, window.devicePixelRatio || 1); W = r.width; H = r.height; cv.width = Math.round(W*dpr); cv.height = Math.round(H*dpr); ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0); }\n  // sample the logo on a G×G grid: each opaque cell becomes a dot, swoosh cells keep their blue\n  function sample(img){\n    var c = document.createElement('canvas'); c.width = c.height = G; var g = c.getContext('2d');\n    g.drawImage(img, 0, 0, G, G); var d = g.getImageData(0, 0, G, G).data; cells = [];\n    for(var y = 0; y < G; y++) for(var x = 0; x < G; x++){\n      var i = (y*G + x)*4, a = d[i+3]; if(a < 40) continue;\n      var r = d[i], gg = d[i+1], b = d[i+2], swoosh = b - r > 60;\n      cells.push({gx:x, gy:y, a:a/255, sw:swoosh, c: swoosh ? 'rgb('+r+','+gg+','+b+')' : null,\n        sx:(Math.random()-.5)*2.4, sy:(Math.random()-.5)*2.4, delay: swoosh ? 0.25 + (x/G)*0.5 : Math.random()*0.45});\n    }\n    t0 = performance.now(); start();\n  }\n  function ease(t){ t = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, t)); return 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3); }\n  function frame(now){\n    var t = (now - t0)/1000, S = Math.min(W, H*1.02) * 0.92, step = S/G, ox = (W - S)/2 - W*0.04, oy = (H - S)/2;\n    var cxm = ox + S/2, cym = oy + S/2;\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, W, H);\n    // faint ambient grid of dots around the mark\n    var gs = step*2, rad = S*0.72;\n    ctx.fillStyle = col.dim;\n    for(var yy = oy - S*0.2; yy < oy + S*1.2; yy += gs) for(var xx = ox - S*0.25; xx < ox + S*1.25; xx += gs){\n      var dd = Math.hypot(xx - cxm, yy - cym); if(dd > rad) continue;\n      var w = Math.sin(dd/22 - t*1.6)*0.5 + 0.5;\n      ctx.globalAlpha = (1 - dd/rad) * (0.05 + w*0.08) * ease(t/1.2); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(xx, yy, 0.9, 0, 6.2832); ctx.fill();\n    }\n    // sweep of light that travels along the swoosh every few seconds\n    var sweep = ((t - 1.6) % 4.5) / 4.5 * 1.6 - 0.3;\n    for(var i = 0; i < cells.length; i++){\n      var c = cells[i], k = ease((t - c.delay) / 1.1);\n      var tx = ox + (c.gx + .5)*step, ty = oy + (c.gy + .5)*step;\n      var x = tx + c.sx*S*0.5*(1 - k), y = ty + c.sy*S*0.5*(1 - k);\n      // pointer pushes dots away a little\n      var mdx = x - mouse.x, mdy = y - mouse.y, md = Math.hypot(mdx, mdy);\n      if(md < 70 && k > .9){ var f = (1 - md/70)*12; x += mdx/md*f || 0; y += mdy/md*f || 0; }\n      var wave = Math.sin((c.gx + c.gy)*0.28 - t*2.2)*0.5 + 0.5;\n      var lit = c.sw ? Math.max(0, 1 - Math.abs(c.gx/G - sweep)*7) : 0;\n      var r = step*(c.sw ? 0.4 : 0.28) * (0.75 + wave*0.35 + lit*0.5);\n      ctx.globalAlpha = k * c.a * (c.sw ? 0.85 + lit*0.15 : (col.light ? 0.22 : 0.3) + wave*0.25);\n      ctx.fillStyle = c.sw ? (lit > 0.35 ? col.teal : c.c) : (col.light ? col.dim : col.ink);\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(x, y, r, 0, 6.2832); ctx.fill();\n    }\n    ctx.globalAlpha = 1;\n    if(!reduce && !document.getElementById('view-login').hidden) raf = requestAnimationFrame(frame); else raf = 0;\n  }\n  function start(){ if(!raf && cells.length){ size(); if(reduce) t0 = -1e5; raf = requestAnimationFrame(frame); } }\n  readColors(); size();\n  var src = css('--mark-dark', '').replace(/^url\\((['\"]?)(.*)\\1\\)$/, '$2');\n  if(src){ var img = new Image(); img.onload = function(){ sample(img); }; img.src = src; }\n  window.addEventListener('resize', function(){ size(); if(!raf) frame(performance.now()); });\n  window.addEventListener('xcore-theme', function(){ readColors(); if(!raf) frame(performance.now()); });\n  var stage = cv.closest('.brand-stage') || cv;\n  stage.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){ var r = cv.getBoundingClientRect(); mouse.x = e.clientX - r.left; mouse.y = e.clientY - r.top; });\n  stage.addEventListener('pointerleave', function(){ mouse.x = mouse.y = -9999; });\n  new MutationObserver(function(){ if(!document.getElementById('view-login').hidden){ readColors(); t0 = performance.now(); start(); } })\n    .observe(document.getElementById('view-login'), {attributes:true, attributeFilter:['hidden']});\n})();\n\n/* ================= boot ================= */\ndecorateLogos();\nbwRender();\nrender();\n</script>\n\n\n<style id=\"kg-embed\">\n#view-login,.side,.scrim,.topbar,#kgFrom{display:none!important}\n#view-app{display:block!important;height:100%}\n.app,.app.collapsed{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important}\n.main{height:100%}\n#toasts,.toasts{z-index:9999}\n</style>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  function start(){\n    try{ window.__signedIn=true; }catch(e){}\n    var p=null; try{ p=(window.frameElement&&window.frameElement.dataset.theme)||null; }catch(e){}\n    if(p&&window.applyTheme) applyTheme(p);\n    if(window.showApp) showApp();\n    if(window.go) go('knowledge-graph');\n  }\n  if(document.readyState==='loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',start); else start();\n  window.addEventListener('load',function(){ if(window.go && String(window.XC_ROUTE||'').indexOf('knowledge-graph')!==0) go('knowledge-graph'); });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n</template>";
